{
  "title": "Trance Gate",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "Tempo-locked step",
        "gate with a per-step",
        "ADSR.",
        "",
        "The ring is the",
        "pattern. Filled arcs",
        "are steps that",
        "sound, hollow ones",
        "are gaps.",
        "",
        "Thickness is the",
        "step's Amount.",
        "",
        "A dot inside the",
        "ring is the",
        "playhead. A bracket",
        "outside it is the",
        "step you are",
        "editing."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Pads",
      "lines": [
        "One pad per step,",
        "from the top left.",
        "",
        "Green: the step",
        " sounds.",
        "Red: it is a gap.",
        "",
        "BRIGHTNESS is that",
        "step's Amount. A",
        "quiet step is a",
        "dimmer pad; it never",
        "goes below about",
        "half, so an on step",
        "always reads as on.",
        "",
        "The SELECTED step is",
        "one shade lighter",
        "than the same step",
        "would be otherwise.",
        "",
        "A press toggles the",
        "step AND selects it.",
        "SHIFT + press sets a",
        "tie: it holds",
        "through the next",
        "step without",
        "retriggering.",
        "",
        "Dark: past the end",
        " of the pattern."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Controls",
      "children": [
        {
          "title": "Gate Page",
          "lines": [
            "Knob 1: Len",
            " Steps in the",
            "  pattern, 1-32.",
            "",
            "Knob 2: Rate",
            " Length of one step.",
            "",
            "Knob 3: All Amount",
            " Dry/wet for the",
            " WHOLE effect.",
            " 0% is a bypass.",
            "",
            " Shown as the bar",
            " down the right",
            " hand side.",
            "",
            "Knobs 4-7:",
            " Attack, Decay,",
            " Sustain, Release.",
            "",
            "Knob 8: Step Amount",
            " How loud THIS step",
            " is. 0% is silent.",
            " Pick the step with",
            " a pad first."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Settings Page",
          "lines": [
            "Attack, Decay,",
            "Sustain, Release",
            "shape every step.",
            "",
            "Gate is how much of",
            "a step stays open",
            "before releasing.",
            "",
            "All Amount is the",
            "dry/wet for the",
            "WHOLE effect. At 0%",
            "the gate is bypassed",
            "and everything",
            "passes through.",
            "",
            "Step Amount (on the",
            "wheel page) is one",
            "step's level. Same",
            "idea, smaller scope.",
            "",
            "Slot picks one of 8",
            "patterns.",
            "",
            "Stop: Open holds the",
            "gate open with no",
            "transport. Free",
            "keeps running."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Timing",
      "lines": [
        "The gate follows",
        "song position, so",
        "it stays bar-aligned",
        "however long it runs",
        "and survives a seek.",
        "",
        "Rate is one step's",
        "length. At 1/16 a",
        "16-step pattern is",
        "one bar.",
        "",
        "Times are in ms and",
        "are NOT synced: a",
        "1/16 step is",
        "15000/BPM ms, so 125",
        "ms at 120. Keep",
        "Attack plus Decay",
        "under that or a step",
        "never reaches full."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
